.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd November 3, 2026
.Dt MK.TST.MK 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mk.tst.mk
.Nd test module role: scripts and programs that test the built software
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fd .include <mk.tst.mk>
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A module directory
.Pa name.tst
holds tests of what a framework built.
Every
.Pa testcases/*.sh
is a test, run with
.Xr atf-sh 1 .
A plain
.Xr make 1
compiles the module, so a compile error in a test shows at build time, but
nothing in it is copied up, installed or shipped.
.Pp
Its scripts see the resulting build output: this module's test directory, its
framework's
.Pa bin ,
the workspace's and each
.Va PARENT_WS Ns 's
are on
.Ev PATH ,
and
.Ev BMK_SHAREDIR
lists their
.Pa share
directories.
.Ss Variables
.Bl -tag -width "TEST_PROG"
.It Va PROG
A utility program the scripts use: built, not registered as a test.
.It Va TEST_PROG
A program that is itself an ATF test program, registered with Kyua.
.It Va TEST_SRCS
The sources of
.Va TEST_PROG ,
relative to
.Pa src/ .
Required when
.Va PROG
is set too, which is then built from the rest.
.It Va LIBS
Libraries to link.
.It Va KYUA
The Kyua to run.
Default
.Pa kyua .
.El
.Pp
A module with neither
.Va PROG
nor
.Va TEST_PROG
holds scripts only, and still reads its hook files.
.Ss Targets
.Bl -tag -width "clean"
.It Cm all
Compile, and stage the scripts.
This is the default.
.It Cm test
Run the tests; see
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 .
.It Cm clean
Remove this key's output.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "testcases/*.sh"
.It Pa src/
compiled sources
.It Pa testcases/*.sh
tests
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
PROG=raster_util
TEST_PROG=raster_test
TEST_SRCS=raster_test.cpp
LIBS=geo
\&.include <mk.tst.mk>
.Ed
.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It PROG= and TEST_PROG= are both set, so TEST_SRCS= must name the test program's sources
Say which sources are the test; the rest build
.Va PROG .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr atf-sh 1 ,
.Xr kyua 1 ,
.Xr mk.atf.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.crosstest.mk 5 ,
.Xr mk.test.mk 5 ,
.Xr bmake-it 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Sylvain Souche
